   "text": "{\n\"meetingId\": \"78\",\n\"tickets\": [\n{\n\"title\": \"Organize estate settlement planning file for Lydia Cloudpuddle\",\n\"text\": \"Organize a planning-side file for Lydia Cloudpuddle's estate settlement coordination separating probate assets, beneficiary assets, estate professionals, family decision points, and household planning impacts. The file covers Nora Velvetreed's estate including a traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody valued at $410,000, a taxable brokerage account at Tin Sparrow Investments valued at $275,000, and a condominium with a county estimate of $620,000, with Sienna Bramblequill of Paper Otter Legal handling probate and trust administration.\",\n\"priority\": null,\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-08-08\",\n\"assigneeId\": null,\n\"subTasks\": [],\n\"templateId\": null,\n\"evidence\": \"The agreed follow-up is to organize that file by 2025-08-08.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"Resolve Missing Signature Packet\",\n\"text\": \"Use this workflow when a document packet cannot be submitted or finalized because one or more required signatures, initials, dates, attestations, or delivery acknowledgments are missing. Confirm the specific signature gap, contact the appropriate signer using approved communication channels, document the outreach, and verify the corrected packet before submission. For Lydia Cloudpuddle's inherited IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody, the claim packet requires a certified death certificate, letters of authority, and a completed beneficiary claim form. Lydia currently has only a photocopy of the death certificate and an unsigned draft claim form.\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-08-01\",\n\"assigneeId\": null,\n\"subTasks\": [\n{\n\"title\": \"Identify the exact signature deficiency\",\n\"text\": \"Review the packet and note each missing item: signer role, document name, page or section, required signature/initial/date, and whether a witness, notary, spouse, trustee, or authorized representative is also required. For Lydia Cloudpuddle's inherited IRA claim packet, the missing items include a certified death certificate (only photocopy available), letters of authority, and a signed beneficiary claim form (currently unsigned draft).\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"assigneeId\": \"0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8\"\n,\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-08-15-08-15-08-15-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155-08-155